1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:10,960
Speaking, task one. Topic 19: Getting around town. Ten questions. Listen to the question and answer out loud.

2
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:13,417
How do you get to work?

3
00:00:19,067 --> 00:00:21,990
I go to work by bus, sometimes by bike.

4
00:00:22,833 --> 00:00:24,033
Do you have a car?

5
00:00:29,667 --> 00:00:33,426
Yes, we have one car, but in town I go by bus.

6
00:00:34,267 --> 00:00:36,224
How much is a bus ticket?

7
00:00:41,867 --> 00:00:45,574
A ticket costs about thirty crowns; I have a monthly pass.

8
00:00:46,433 --> 00:00:48,286
Where do you buy tickets?

9
00:00:53,933 --> 00:00:56,517
I buy tickets in an app on my phone.

10
00:00:57,367 --> 00:00:59,402
How long does it take to get to the centre?

11
00:01:05,067 --> 00:01:07,938
It takes about twenty minutes by tram to get to the centre.

12
00:01:08,800 --> 00:01:10,365
Do you like taking the metro?

13
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:19,289
Yes, the metro is fast, but in the morning it's crowded.

14
00:01:20,133 --> 00:01:22,090
Have you ever had a problem on public transport?

15
00:01:27,733 --> 00:01:31,153
Once I forgot my ticket and had to pay a fine.

16
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:33,748
How did you get here today?

17
00:01:39,400 --> 00:01:42,193
Today I came by train and then I walked.

18
00:01:43,033 --> 00:01:44,703
Are you going to buy a car?

19
00:01:50,367 --> 00:01:53,107
Yes, next year I'll buy a small car.

20
00:01:53,967 --> 00:01:56,524
What would you improve about transport in your town?

21
00:02:02,167 --> 00:02:05,377
I would improve the evening buses, because there aren't many.

22
00:02:06,233 --> 00:02:15,896
Great! Practise topic 19 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website — the link is in the video description. And subscribe to the channel — there's a new video every day.
